
# 🌐 — Introduction to Networking
> "Networks connect devices. The Internet connects the world."

---


# 🌍 What is a Network?

> A **network** is a group of devices connected together so they can communicate and share resources.

These devices may communicate through:

-🔌 Wired connections (Ethernet)
- 📶 Wireless connections (Wi-Fi)

A network can be as small as two computers or as large as the Internet.

---

# 🧠 Simple Analogy

Imagine a city.

```
House 🏠
     │
     │ Road
     │
School 🏫
```

People travel using roads.

In networking,

```
Computer 💻
      │
      │ Network
      │
Server 🖥
```

Data travels using the network.

The network acts like a road for digital information.

---

# 💡 Why Do We Need Networks?

Without networking,

❌ No Google

❌ No YouTube

❌ No Online Games

❌ No WhatsApp

❌ No Cloud Storage

Every modern online service depends on networking.

---

# 📌 Main Purposes of Networking


Networking allows us to:

✅ Share files

✅ Share printers

✅ Access the Internet

✅ Communicate instantly

✅ Work together remotely

✅ Store data centrally

